  "recordSet": [],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "CancerVerse",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\ud83e\ude7b CancerVerse\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tThe first longitudinal, multimodal CT dataset spanning 13 malignant tumor types\n\t\n\nCancerVerse pairs whole-body abdominal/pelvic CT volumes with the radiologists' own free-text reports, follows patients across time, and is being released in stages \u2014 culminating in expert voxel-level tumor masks and a deep clinical & longitudinal annotation layer. It is built to power the next generation of cancer-aware medical AI: tumor detection and segmentation\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/BodyMaps/CancerVerse.",
